  "cooked": "<p>I noticed my peer-observer nodes spending a lot of time in <code>b-msghand</code> thread today on 2026-02-17 starting around 1:30 am UTC. Note that the screenshots are UTC+1.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/10e1b90a76dc23d36d86c2ad261cf61649cdf4c5.png\" data-download-href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/10e1b90a76dc23d36d86c2ad261cf61649cdf4c5\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/10e1b90a76dc23d36d86c2ad261cf61649cdf4c5_2_689x396.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"2plfoXNWKY57O4EccyUwjEY1We1\" width=\"689\" height=\"396\" srcset=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/10e1b90a76dc23d36d86c2ad261cf61649cdf4c5_2_689x396.png, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/10e1b90a76dc23d36d86c2ad261cf61649cdf4c5_2_1033x594.png 1.5x, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/10e1b90a76dc23d36d86c2ad261cf61649cdf4c5.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"5E6F42\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1148\u00d7659 86.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>(red means we spend 1000ms out of 1000ms (i.e. 100%) of our time in the thread)</p>\n<p>Around the same time, the mempools started to fill up from around 6% to 60%</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/7cbe595d244a0357219653cf9bd6f6da11ce7bef.png\" data-download-href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/7cbe595d244a0357219653cf9bd6f6da11ce7bef\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/7cbe595d244a0357219653cf9bd6f6da11ce7bef_2_690x285.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"hNx1H943gZ8wFTkKT0lOiD5iiOH\" width=\"690\" height=\"285\" srcset=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/7cbe595d244a0357219653cf9bd6f6da11ce7bef_2_690x285.png, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/7cbe595d244a0357219653cf9bd6f6da11ce7bef.png 1.5x, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/7cbe595d244a0357219653cf9bd6f6da11ce7bef.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"141519\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">937\u00d7388 48.5 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>and the sum(inv-to-send) sizes across all peers increased significantly. To about 1.7 M on some nodes.</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/0e83c651d28397b4a19c736b17df3d7566bc70dd.png\" data-download-href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/0e83c651d28397b4a19c736b17df3d7566bc70dd\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/0e83c651d28397b4a19c736b17df3d7566bc70dd_2_690x381.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"24p0Ey7oYkcNBYuds0qjcYAY6Xr\" width=\"690\" height=\"381\" srcset=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/0e83c651d28397b4a19c736b17df3d7566bc70dd_2_690x381.png, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/0e83c651d28397b4a19c736b17df3d7566bc70dd_2_1035x571.png 1.5x, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/0e83c651d28397b4a19c736b17df3d7566bc70dd.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"131314\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1045\u00d7578 36.1 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>with the maxium inv-to-send sizes being about 60k</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/c839d2e769154ac66240aad1b7076eeda2cbc34c.png\" data-download-href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/c839d2e769154ac66240aad1b7076eeda2cbc34c\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/c839d2e769154ac66240aad1b7076eeda2cbc34c_2_690x405.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"szhnCXzyzD51KSIEAsJUDezYsDq\" width=\"690\" height=\"405\" srcset=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/c839d2e769154ac66240aad1b7076eeda2cbc34c_2_690x405.png, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/c839d2e769154ac66240aad1b7076eeda2cbc34c_2_1035x607.png 1.5x, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/c839d2e769154ac66240aad1b7076eeda2cbc34c.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"111113\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1045\u00d7614 40.8 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<p>edit: It was also visible in the Bitcoin protocol Ping-Pong time monitoring I do on localhost:</p>\n<p><div class=\"lightbox-wrapper\"><a class=\"lightbox\" href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/d0c1429324e8d8d2760a5e6c861a3d95d4fd8aec.png\" data-download-href=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/d0c1429324e8d8d2760a5e6c861a3d95d4fd8aec\" title=\"image\"><img src=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/d0c1429324e8d8d2760a5e6c861a3d95d4fd8aec_2_690x455.png\" alt=\"image\" data-base62-sha1=\"tMJn2uR3QBvngSZ2xnJ64qbVoIY\" width=\"690\" height=\"455\" srcset=\"https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/d0c1429324e8d8d2760a5e6c861a3d95d4fd8aec_2_690x455.png, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/optimized/1X/d0c1429324e8d8d2760a5e6c861a3d95d4fd8aec_2_1035x682.png 1.5x, https://bnoc.xyz/uploads/default/original/1X/d0c1429324e8d8d2760a5e6c861a3d95d4fd8aec.png 2x\" data-dominant-color=\"242526\"><div class=\"meta\"><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-far-image svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#far-image\"></use></svg><span class=\"filename\">image</span><span class=\"informations\">1052\u00d7694 163 KB</span><svg class=\"fa d-icon d-icon-discourse-expand svg-icon\" aria-hidden=\"true\"><use href=\"#discourse-expand\"></use></svg></div></a></div></p>\n<hr>\n<p>Randomly sampling from some of the transactions my nodes saw:</p>\n<ul>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.oklink.com/bitcoin/tx/cc472d9cec6a8155de69e610f6ad7981040b324c2b3141eec208f55333f6364b/transfer\" class=\"inline-onebox\">Bitcoin Transaction Hash cc472d...f6364b | Blockchain Explorer | OKLink</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.oklink.com/bitcoin/tx/a9dcfedaf4771950f9d384dabf45a3556764a41145f638c46140990603d3a4e5/transfer\" class=\"inline-onebox\">Bitcoin Transaction Hash a9dcfe...d3a4e5 | Blockchain Explorer | OKLink</a></li>\n<li><a href=\"https://www.oklink.com/bitcoin/tx/8b9e4a4c7e4a77c9c6f05f18ac3407c5aa02517d9b55e74ba653c846f57d8179/transfer\" class=\"inline-onebox\">Bitcoin Transaction Hash 8b9e4a...7d8179 | Blockchain Explorer | OKLink</a></li>\n</ul>\n<p>All include a UNCOMMON\u2022GOODS rune, some also inscriptions, and NFT related content.</p>",
